sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebUI
    participant API as Flask API
    participant DP as DataProcessor
    participant DD as DiseaseDetector
    participant NM as NeuralMassModel
    participant 3DV as Three.js Viewer

    User->>WebUI: Upload MRI (.nii)
    WebUI->>API: POST /api/detect
    API->>DP: preprocess(file)
    DP-->>API: brain_data
    API->>DD: predict(brain_data)
    DD-->>API: {disease: "Glioma", conf: 0.95}
    API-->>WebUI: Analysis Result
    
    User->>WebUI: Click "Run Simulation"
    WebUI->>API: POST /api/simulate
    API->>NM: simulate(params)
    NM-->>API: signals, connectivity
    API-->>WebUI: Simulation Data
    
    WebUI->>3DV: Render(brain_mesh, vessels)
    3DV-->>User: Interactive 3D View
